<title>USA: CNET sells E! Online stake to E!.</title>
<headline>CNET sells E! Online stake to E!.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>E! Entertainment Television said it purchased the 50 percent interest in E! Online from CNET Inc.</p>
<p>CNET also agreed to license certain technology to E! Entertainment and to provide technological and marketing consulting services to E! Online.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
